# Third-party Adreno driver blobs (~93 MB in total). Stored as REGULAR git
# objects on purpose.
#
# History: these were converted to Git LFS by `git lfs migrate import
# --above=50MB` on the build node, but the LFS objects were never pushed
# successfully -- every oid returns 404 from the server. The entities were
# recovered from a build output tree (byte sizes match the original pointers
# exactly) and are now tracked as plain blobs.
#
# Size check: the largest file here is 55 MB. GitHub's hard limit is 100 MB
# per file, so plain git storage is fine. Pushes will show a soft warning
# above 50 MB (GH001); that warning is expected and harmless.
#
# Provenance of the driver package: see gpu-q3/README.
